{"diagnosis": "Fetch never progresses (max_addr 0x00000000, TRAP no progress). reg_next_pc is assigned current_pc instead of advanced PC, so PC sticks at 0 and fetch repeats. Root cause in excerpt lines 1526-1527 is missing compressed-aware increment for sequential fetch.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -1526,3 +1526,3 @@
 				reg_pc <= current_pc;
-				reg_next_pc <= current_pc;
+				reg_next_pc <= current_pc + (compressed_instr ? 32'd2 : 32'd4);
 				latched_store <= 0;
", "expected": "tohost PASS 0x1, max_addr 0x000003fc after 256 NOPs, no TRAP no-progress"}

